## no_such_key (exit 1)
error[Z0204]: no key `2` in the mapping
 --> scripts/main.zeff:1:12
  |
1 | [1 => "a"][2]
  |            ^ not a key
  |
  = help: `is_in(k, keys(m))` tests for a key first (release 0.5.0); the keys are those written in the mapping

